Still 1.2.0. Build 178 is withdrawn; this is build 177 with only the one change you asked for.

178 broke music resuming, the phone meter and tap detection on both microphones. It has been reverted wholesale rather than patched.

What remains is the separation on its own: the phone's rules and the helmet's rules now live in separate code, so one can change without the other. On the phone it is amplitude alone — a sharp peak with a fast decline. Nothing outside the detector was touched.
